variable structure

00:22:08.121 --> 00:22:09.345
from a model like this,

00:22:09.346 --> 00:22:10.685
and then embed it

00:22:10.686 --> 00:22:13.905
in a model that's maybe
simpler to compute.

00:22:13.906 --> 00:22:16.315
So, that's also something
I would think in

00:22:16.316 --> 00:22:19.120
and could be useful in
tech firms as well.

00:22:19.121 --> 00:22:21.590
Okay. So, basically
we're going to apply

00:22:21.591 --> 00:22:23.690
