American Economic Association,

00:22:46.691 --> 00:22:48.325
and so, this paper,

00:22:48.326 --> 00:22:50.450
I'm actually going in reverse
order chronologically.

00:22:50.451 --> 00:22:51.890
This is the last paper we wrote,

00:22:51.891 --> 00:22:53.380
the last paper we began,

00:22:53.381 --> 00:22:55.130
but it's the simplest
