00:22:55.131 --> 00:22:56.325
So I'm going to start there and

00:22:56.326 --> 00:22:57.930
then get more complicated.

00:22:57.931 --> 00:23:00.735
So, here from the
counterfactual questions

00:23:00.736 --> 00:23:01.940
are questions like: Where's

00:23:01.941 --> 00:23:03.200
