Who are restaurants competitors?

00:23:07.761 --> 00:23:10.915
How far will a consumer travel
to a restaurant they like?

00:23:10.916 --> 00:23:12.770
I would say, these
are examples of sort

00:23:12.771 --> 00:23:14.600
