things like that,

00:27:24.966 --> 00:27:27.270
then I need to think
about why the consumer

00:27:27.271 --> 00:27:29.920
liked what they did in order
to infer their choices.

00:27:29.921 --> 00:27:32.000
So, the way that we've typically
done this in economics,

00:27:32.001 --> 00:27:33.350
there's a few people who
do this but this isn't,

00:27:33.351 --> 00:27:34.785
usually this is done with price.

00:27:34.786 --> 00:27:37.470
Then the second two papers
we're going to focus

00:27:37.471 --> 00:27:38.620
