00:27:38.621 --> 00:27:40.475
distance that we're
learning the effective.

00:27:40.476 --> 00:27:43.810
Okay. So, then this

00:27:43.811 --> 00:27:46.790
is part of what Dan McFadden
got the Nobel Prize for,

00:27:46.791 --> 00:27:48.570
now this might seem, this
is not terribly deep,

