01:25:23.571 --> 01:25:24.790
you can actually use in practice.

01:25:24.791 --> 01:25:25.820
So, it's different between

01:25:25.821 --> 01:25:27.270
the foundations of
science sometimes.

01:25:27.271 --> 01:25:28.370
I think that's where it

